of the type of money making approach that you guys figured out because it was a hugely successful team, right? The arbitrage team. Yes. Well, I think that one trade that comes to mind that was early, I think there's a better trade that was a little bit later. But one of the earliest things that I was involved in on the desk that was, you know, the desk was already doing, it wasn't my idea, but it was a great trade. And it really kind of shows a little bit about how everything worked together.

